cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "NDOS: a framework for organising wet-lab and animal neuroscience data"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Alikarami
    given-names: Elnaz
repository-code: "https://github.com/Elnazkarami/N-DOS"
abstract: >-
  A BIDS-inspired standard and reference implementation for pre-publication
  wet-lab and animal neuroscience data. NDOS reads archives without extracting
  them, reconstructs a standard layout derived from whatever structure already
  exists, captures metadata through the spreadsheets labs already use, answers
  cohort queries with the evidence behind every match, records provenance from
  a result back to raw data, and hands off to BIDS and NWB workflows.
keywords:
  - neuroscience
  - electrophysiology
  - research data management
  - provenance
  - BIDS
  - NWB
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
